sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sender Thread (Loop)
    participant RA as RecordAccumulator
    participant BQ as Batches Queue
    participant Sel as Selector (NIO)
    participant Net as Network

    loop Sender Run Loop
        S ->> RA: get ready batches
        Note over S, RA: 检查哪些节点的分区有可发送的Batch
        RA -->> S: List<ReadyBatch>

        S ->> BQ: group by target node
        Note over S, BQ: 将Batch按目标Broker节点分组，构建ClientRequest

        S ->> Sel: register writes for requests
        Note over S, Sel: 将请求注册到Selector，关注可写事件

        loop For each ready SelectionKey
            Sel ->> S: channel is writable
            S ->> Net: send ClientRequest
            Note over S, Net: 通过Channel将数据发送至网络
            Net -->> S: send result
        end

        S ->> Sel: check for completed sends
        Note over S, Sel: 检查是否有发送完成的请求，处理响应
    end
